# __name__ — a TanStack Start SSR frontend

__name__ (`@astra/__name__`) is an SSR frontend built on the site-kit preset
(`libs/ts/site-kit/README.md`). It runs as the Compose service `__name__` on port __port__
(`service.name=astra.__name__`) behind Caddy at `https://__name__.iridi.cc`.

## Operations

- Dev server: `just dev __name__/web`.
- Deploy: `just deploy __name__`.

## Traps

- The cross-app frontend traps are in `libs/ts/site-kit/README.md` and
  `libs/ts/gothic/README.md`.
